{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Ask for a service"},"description":"Tell Divisi the person needs a service where they farm, so they are\ntold when it arrives there. `need`: inputs (seed and fertiliser), finance\n(a farm loan), insurance (cover), tractor, transport (to market),\nagronomist (an expert visit), soil_test, vet, storage, events (field\ndays), labour (farm hands) or control (stopping a pest or disease, named\nin `pest_or_disease`). `detail` narrows it when asked: inputs seed or\nfertiliser; finance inputs, equipment or cash; insurance crop, animals\nor family; labour planting or harvest. `crop` names the crop for seed,\nfertiliser, loans, crop cover and field days. `remind_on` asks for a\nreminder that day instead. The place is their farm's area. This is\ndemand, not an application: nothing is shared and nothing is paid.\nAsking twice keeps one request; pass the same `client_id` to retry.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"crop":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Crop"},"detail":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Detail"},"need":{"enum":["inputs","finance","insurance","tractor","transport","agronomist","soil_test","vet","storage","events","labour","control"],"title":"Need","type":"string"},"pest_or_disease":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Pest Or Disease"},"remind_on":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Remind On"}},"required":["need"],"title":"express_interestArguments","type":"object"},"name":"express_interest","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"Request":{"properties":{"area":{"default":"","title":"Area","type":"string"},"arrival_link":{"default":"","title":"Arrival Link","type":"s